  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "API Experience Operator Guide",
      "description": "Action guide for chat, streaming, and API experience. No Data means check Gateway scrape and live stream traffic first.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "targets": [],
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## API Experience — 채팅·스트리밍·지연 진단 / chat, streaming, and latency\n- 요청 수, p95/p99 지연, 5xx 비율을 먼저 확인합니다.\n- `stream=true` 요청: chunk 수, byte 처리량, 오류, usage event metric으로 relay 상태를 확인합니다.\n- TTFT p95: `Streaming Time to First Token p95`. 스트림 전체 지연 p95: `Streaming Duration p95`. 응답당 chunk: `Chunks per Response p95`.\n- Gateway vs upstream 비교: `Gateway vs Upstream p95` 패널에서 병목 위치를 확인합니다.\n- No Data: Gateway `/metrics` scrape와 streaming code path 실행 여부를 확인합니다.\n- Prompt / 사용자 텍스트 / 모델 출력은 metric label에 절대 포함하지 않습니다.\n- `streaming_requests_total.status`와 `streaming_duration_seconds.status`는 터미널 카테고리 label만 사용합니다: `started`, `completed`, `error`, `client_disconnect`.\n"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {},
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat Request Rate",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: non-zero during active sessions. Attention/주의: zero request rate when user traffic is expected. Action Required/조치 필요: 0 with open sessions is a routing or gateway issue. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape and gateway /metrics endpoint.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[$window]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "rps"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "decimals": 2
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat p95 Latency",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: p95 latency within SLO. Attention/주의: rising p95 before error rate often indicates runtime pressure. Action Required/조치 필요: p95 above 10s needs runtime drill-down. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape and gateway histogram.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 4,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[$window])) by (le))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p95"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat p99 Latency",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: p99 latency within SLO. Attention/주의: p99 higher than p95 by large margin may indicate tail-latency issues. Action Required/조치 필요: p99 above 10s needs immediate investigation. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape and gateway histogram.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 8,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.99, sum(rate(http_request_duration_seconds_bucket{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[$window])) by (le))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "p99"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 3,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 5.0
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 10.0
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Chat 5xx Rate",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: 5xx ratio near zero. Attention/주의: above 1% needs triage. Action Required/조치 필요: above 5% means users are experiencing failures. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Prometheus scrape and gateway request counter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[$window])) / clamp_min(sum(increase(http_requests_total{service=\"gateway\",route=\"/v1/chat/completions\"}[$window])), 1)",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "5xx ratio"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
        "textMode": "auto"
      },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "orange",
                "value": 0.01
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 0.05
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Streaming Errors",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: 0 streaming errors. Attention/주의: any errors need investigation. Action Required/조치 필요: sustained streaming errors with active traffic. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Gateway scrape and streaming error counter.",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "${datasource}"
      },
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 16,
        "y": 5,
        "w": 4,
        "h": 4
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "expr": "sum(increase(streaming_errors_total{service=\"gateway\",target=~\"$model\"}[$window]))",
          "refId": "A",
          "legendFormat": "errors"
        }
      ],
      "options": {
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "none",
        "justifyMode": "center",
