          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "Usage Chunk Events",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: usage events proportional to completed streaming requests. Attention/주의: missing usage events may indicate incomplete accounting. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Gateway scrape and streaming usage counter.",
