      "title": "Streaming Chunk Rate",
      "description": "Healthy/정상: chunks/sec increases with streaming traffic. Attention/주의: chunk rate drops while request rate holds may indicate relay stall. Action Required/조치 필요: chunk rate near zero with active streaming requests. No Data/런타임 데이터 없음: check Gateway scrape and streaming chunk counter.",
